category></item><item><title>Experimental demonstration of broadband-laser suppression of cross-beam energy transfer</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.36528</link><description>arXiv:2609.36528v1 Announce Type: cross Abstract: In direct-drive inertial confinement fusion (ICF), cross-beam energy transfer (CBET) redirects a significant fraction of the incident laser energy out of the plasma. We report the experimental demonstration that broadband lasers reduce CBET-enhanced reflected-light return, performed at the low-coherence Kunwu laser facility with two crossed beams of 0.6% bandwidth and up to 550J at $\sim$2.6$\times$10$^{14}$ W/cm$^{2}$. A coupled ray-tracing mode</description><guid isPermaLink="false">fd4a7446d644</guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T10:22:28.224281+00:00</pubDate><source>arXiv 光学与光子学 (physics.optics)</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>精密光纤激光器企业频准激光登陆科创板</title><link>https://www.coema.org.cn/industry/202608/5795.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">c07a5116421d</guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T10:22:28.224281+00:00</pubDate><source>COEMA 中国光电子行业协会</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>享界V8开启预售,配896线激光雷达,增程和纯电双动力可选</title><link>https://weixin.sogou.com/link?url=dn9a_-gY295K0Rci_xozVXfdMkSQTLW6cwJThYulHEtVjXrGTiVgS9ywPCwteS2KXkcFWpilkT69QsCaK0kRh1qXa8Fplpd9oE4eG5vcrmmalEWppz_564MEieg-3u_Sc3QzQbva5XTDqfj1fctRNsj0X-zXg-XGAaEjab8fCffToa-YcPFM80uK23qXccipA8QBW8ej5rxJga_8W59heBGh38YXeypOM9AUVvulIgW0WXbcwn4hs0oeDXGixMWV_DcJ8ki4UJfzAjcIGepUqA..&amp;amp;type=2&amp;amp;query=%E6%BF%80%E5%85%89%E9%9B%B7%E8%BE%BE&amp;amp;token=A218BC4B9E003F4BE7EEBB5743B84108E89724746ABCE2DC</link><description>9月28日,鸿蒙智行享界V8正式开启预售,新车定位家庭智慧旗舰MPV,车顶配备896线激光雷达,提供增程和纯电双动力可选,车身...</description><guid isPermaLink="false">aa41af35775c</guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T10:22:28.224281+00:00</pubDate><source>搜狗微信·光电行业 · 趣味车视界</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>智界RX正式上市,搭载四激光雷达矩阵,单电机和双电机驱动可选</title><link>https://weixin.sogou.com/link